---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy, cookies and advertising policy for Tiago Alves de Oliveira's academic portal."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    current="Privacy"
    homeLabel="Home"
    homeHref="/en/"
    description="Information about data, cookies, third-party services and advertising on this portal."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <article class="card content-panel legal-content">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 21, 2026.</p>

        <h2>1. Scope</h2>
        <p>This policy applies to tiagofga.com.br and the institutional pages published directly on this domain. Linked projects and external services may have their own policies.</p>

        <h2>2. Technical data and logs</h2>
        <p>The portal is primarily static and does not require user registration. Hosting, DNS/CDN and third-party providers may process technical data required for delivery and security, such as IP address, request date and time, browser, operating system and access logs.</p>

        <h2>3. Cookies and local storage</h2>
        <p>The portal itself uses browser local storage to preserve the light or dark theme preference. Third-party services that may be enabled, including advertising, can use cookies and similar technologies according to their own purposes and policies.</p>

        <h2>4. Google AdSense and advertising</h2>
        <p>When Google AdSense advertising is enabled, third parties, including Google, may use cookies to serve, measure and personalize ads based on previous visits to this and other websites. Google and its partners may also use identifiers, IP addresses and similar technologies for measurement, fraud prevention and advertising.</p>
        <p>Users can manage ad personalization through Google's ad settings. Advertising on this portal will be enabled together with the consent mechanisms required for applicable regions.</p>

        <h2>5. External services and links</h2>
        <p>The portal links to GitHub, CEFET-MG, academic projects and other external services. Their respective policies and terms apply when those services are accessed.</p>

        <h2>6. Academic content and historical archive</h2>
        <p>Historical materials are published for academic and documentary purposes. Student personal data, grades, administrative documents and restricted materials should not be included in the public archive.</p>

        <h2>7. Rights and contact</h2>
        <p>Requests concerning privacy, correction or removal of public content can be sent through the professional channels listed on the contact page.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated as new services, measurement tools or advertising features are added. The revision date will be updated on this page.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
